## Enforcement Notice

**This project uses WogiFlow with HARD ENFORCEMENT via OpenCode plugins.**

The WogiFlow plugin (`/.opencode/plugins/wogiflow.js`) will:
- **Block** file edits without an active task
- **Inject** context at session start
- **Run** validation after file changes
- **Trigger** research protocol for capability questions

Unlike Codex (advisory only), OpenCode provides the same enforcement level as Claude Code.

